// Automaton warden: the guardian at the end of the first playable loop (voyage wardens_gate). A shielded heart
// between two armed fists, each section with its own automaton core and its own 6 MW (heart: a cannon in its nose
// and a shield emitter; each fist: two cannons and a thruster), joined by one bridge block per fist. Shot apart,
// the fists fly on as vessels of their own (GDR-0013) and the heart fights on until its core or its cannon is
// gone. The heart's cannon (GDR-0068: a site clears when its enemies are destroyed or disarmed) took the place of
// its second shield emitter, so each section still runs on its own 6 MW. PLACEHOLDER layout and numbers
// (docs/plans/slice-content.md 2.2, track 7J draft of 13 Oct 2026; tuned in track 7K).
